## Commits
340e6893 refactor: uniform low/medium/high/max thinking map, drop official per-model tlm/compat passthrough

## Files changed
 src/gateway-catalog.ts       | 30 ++++++++++++------------------
 test/gateway-catalog.test.ts | 26 ++++++++++----------------
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

